CARE-COV-0163,Care Health,Care,2.2. Specific Definitions,3,"Complete Blood Count with ESR, Urine Routine, Blood Group, Fasting Blood Sugar, Lipid Profile, Liver Function Test , (iii) Medical Tests covered in the Annual Health Check-up, applicable for Care 7, for Insured Persons who are of Age 18 years or above on the Policy Period Start Date, are as follows :- Plan Check-up Care 2, Care 3 & Care 8 Creatinine, Calcium Care 4 & Care 9 SGPT Care 5 & Care 6 Kidney Function Test Infection Markers Complete Blood Count(CBC) ESR ABO Group & Rh Type Urine Routine Stool Routine Liver Function Test S Bilirubin (Total/Direct) SGPT SGOT GGT Alkaline Phosphatase Total Protein Albumin : Globulin Kidney Function Test Creatinine Blood Urea Nitrogen Uric Acid Estimated GFR, GFR category, Urea, Blood Urea Nitrogen / Creatinine ratio Protein Total, Albumin, Globulin, A:G ratio, Calcium, Phosphorous, Electrolytes, Serum TSH Profile Diabetes Markers Hba1c Vitamin D & B12 Hs-CRP (iv) Medical Tests covered in the Annual Health Check-up, applicable for Insured Persons who are of Age below 18 years on the Policy Period Start Date for all Plans except Care 1, are as follows:",COVERAGE,True,"Complete Blood Count with ESR, Urine Routine, Blood Group, Fasting Blood Sugar, Lipid Profile, Liver Function Test , (iii) Medical Tests covered in the Annual Health Check-up, applicable for Care 7, for Insured Persons who are of Age 18 years or above on the Policy Period Start Date, are as follows :- Plan Check-up Care 2, Care 3 & Care 8 Creatinine, Calcium Care 4 & Care 9 SGPT Care 5 & Care 6 Kidney Function Test Infection Markers Complete Blood Count(CBC) ESR ABO Group & Rh Type Urine Routine Stool Routine Liver Function Test S Bilirubin (Total/Direct) SGPT SGOT GGT Alkaline Phosphatase Tot",18 years
