CARE-EXC-0244,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.9,"Any Claim in respect of any Insured Person for, arising out of or directly or indirectly due to any of the following shall not be admissible, unless expressly stated to the contrary elsewhere in the Policy terms and conditions:",EXCLUSION,True,"Any Claim in respect of any Insured Person for, arising out of or directly or indirectly due to any of the following shall not be admissible, unless expressly stated to the contrary elsewhere in the Policy terms and conditions:",
