CARE-COV-0258,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.15,"Optional Cover 15: Advance Annual Health Check-up On the Policyholder's/ Insured Person's request, through Cashless Facility, the Company will arrange for the Insured Person's medical tests as opted below under this Benefit, at Network Provider or other Service Providers specifically empanelled with the Company to provide the services, in India, subject to the conditions specified below:",COVERAGE,True,"Optional Cover 15: Advance Annual Health Check-up On the Policyholder's/ Insured Person's request, through Cashless Facility, the Company will arrange for the Insured Person's medical tests as opted below under this Benefit, at Network Provider or other Service Providers specifically empanelled with the Company to provide the services, in India, subject to the conditions specified below:",
CARE-COV-0259,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.15,"Medical Tests covered for Insured Persons who are of Age 18 years or above on the Policy Period Start Date, are as follows :- Set No List of Medical Tests covered Option 1 ECG, TMT Option 2 ECG, TMT, Lung Function Test, X-Ray – Chest, Ultrasound Abdomen.",COVERAGE,False,,18 years
CARE-COV-0260,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.16,"Optional Cover 16 : Room Rent Modification Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Policy, if this Optional Benefit is opted, the Company agrees to modify the Room Rent/ Room Category to Single Private Room/No Limit as specified in Policy schedule.",COVERAGE,True,"Optional Cover 16 : Room Rent Modification Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Policy, if this Optional Benefit is opted, the Company agrees to modify the Room Rent/ Room Category to Single Private Room/No Limit as specified in Policy schedule.",
