CARE-COV-0262,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.16(ii),"If the eligible Room Rent or Room Category applicable for the Insured Person under the Policy is 'No limit', which means that there is no separate restriction on Room Charges incurred towards stay during Hospitalization.",COVERAGE,False,,
