CARE-COV-0264,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.17,"Optional Cover 17: Be-Fit Benefit The Insured Person, who is above 12 years of age, may avail unlimited visits to the Fitness Centers in a Policy year at the Company's network.",COVERAGE,False,,12 years
