CARE-COV-0266,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.18,"Optional Cover 18: Co-payment Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Policy, it is hereby stated that on opting this optional Cover, the Insured Person or eldest Insured Person (in case of floater) whose age is 61 years or above will bear a Co-payment (over & above any other co-payment, if any), which applies to such Insured Person or all Insured Persons (in case of Floater) as specified in the Policy Schedule, in accordance with Clause 6.1.6 and Company's liability shall be restricted to the balance amount payable.",COVERAGE,True,"Optional Cover 18: Co-payment Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Policy, it is hereby stated that on opting this optional Cover, the Insured Person or eldest Insured Person (in case of floater) whose age is 61 years or above will bear a Co-payment (over & above any other co-payment, if any), which applies to such Insured Person or all Insured Persons (in case of Floater) as specified in the Policy Schedule, in accordance with Clause 6.1.6 and Company's liability shall be restricted to the balance amount payable.",61 years
CARE-COV-0267,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.19,"Optional Cover 19 : Loyalty Bonus In case of no claim has been paid by the Company for 3 consecutive Policy Years, then 3 times of base Sum Insured will be provided as bonus on subsequent renewal. This benefit shall be provided only once in lifetime of the Policy and subject to the conditions specified below:",COVERAGE,True,This benefit shall be provided only once in lifetime of the Policy and subject to the conditions specified below:,
CARE-EXC-0268,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.19(i),The Loyalty Bonus shall not enhance or be deemed to enhance any Conditions as prescribed under Clause 3.1.1(iii).,EXCLUSION,False,,
CARE-COV-0269,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.19(iv),"If the Insured Persons in the expiring policy are covered on a Floater basis and such Insured Persons renew their expiring Policy with the Company by splitting the Floater Sum Insured in to 2 (two) or more Floater / Individual covers, then the Loyalty Bonus shall be apportioned to such renewed Policy in the proportion of the Base Sum Insured of each of the renewed Policy.",COVERAGE,False,,
CARE-EXC-0270,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.19(vi),The Recharge amount ('Automatic Recharge' & 'Unlimited Automatic Recharge') shall not be considered while calculating 'Loyalty Bonus'.,EXCLUSION,False,,
CARE-COV-0271,Care Health,Care,3.2. OPTIONAL COVERS,3.2.19(vii),"Along with the Benefits (Base Covers) under the Policy, accrued 'Loyalty Bonus' can be utilized for Optional Cover 1 (Global Coverage – Total) and Optional Cover 13 (Extension of Global Coverage), if opted for.",COVERAGE,False,,
CARE-EXC-0272,Care Health,Care,4.1. Standard Exclusions,,a. Expenses related to the treatment of a pre-existing Disease (PED) and its direct complications shall be excluded until the expiry of 36 months of continuous coverage after the date of inception of the first policy with insurer.,EXCLUSION,False,,36 months
