CARE-EXC-0278,Care Health,Care,4.1. Standard Exclusions,,d. The waiting period for listed conditions shall apply even if contracted after the policy or declared and accepted without a specific exclusion.,EXCLUSION,False,,
CARE-WAI-0279,Care Health,Care,4.1. Standard Exclusions,,"e. If the Insured Person is continuously covered without any break as defined under the applicable norms on portability stipulated by IRDAI, then waiting period for the same would be reduced to the extent of prior coverage.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
