CARE-EXC-0281,Care Health,Care,4.1. Standard Exclusions,14,"a. Expenses related to the treatment of any illness within 30 days from the first policy commencement date shall be excluded except claims arising due to an accident, provided the same are covered.",EXCLUSION,True,"Expenses related to the treatment of any illness within 30 days from the first policy commencement date shall be excluded except claims arising due to an accident, provided the same are covered.",30 days
CARE-EXC-0282,Care Health,Care,4.1. Standard Exclusions,14,"b. This exclusion shall not, however, apply if the Insured Person has Continuous Coverage for more than twelve months.",EXCLUSION,True,"This exclusion shall not, however, apply if the Insured Person has Continuous Coverage for more than twelve months.",12 months
