CARESU-EXC-0513,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.6,"3 25,00,000 10,00,000 2,50,000 22,50,000 Claim not payable as Sum Insured is exhausted.",EXCLUSION,False,,
CARESU-COV-0514,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.7,"Co-payment If this Optional Benefit is opted, then the Insured Person will have an option to bear a Co-payment, as specified in the Policy Schedule, and the Company's liability shall be restricted to the balance amount payable.",COVERAGE,False,,
CARESU-COV-0515,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.8,"New Born cover Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Policy, by choosing this Optional Benefit, the Company will allow the addition of New Born baby from day 1.",COVERAGE,True,"New Born cover Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Policy, by choosing this Optional Benefit, the Company will allow the addition of New Born baby from day 1.",
CARESU-WAI-0516,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.8,Note: All the applicable waiting period shall stand valid for this benefit. Premium of this optional Benefit shall be payable only at the time of addition of new born and will be pro-rated for the exposure period.,WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
CARESU-COV-0517,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.9,"Plus Benefit An additional amount as specified in the Policy Schedule will be available to the Insured Person for all claims (admissible under Base Benefits) during the Policy Year, subject to the following conditions:",COVERAGE,True,"Plus Benefit An additional amount as specified in the Policy Schedule will be available to the Insured Person for all claims (admissible under Base Benefits) during the Policy Year, subject to the following conditions:",
CARESU-COV-0518,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.9,a. This Plus Benefit would be applied on the base Sum Insured only.,COVERAGE,False,,
CARESU-COV-0519,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.9,c. The Plus Benefit can be utilized for any number of claims admissible under the Policy during the Policy Year.,COVERAGE,False,,
CARESU-EXC-0520,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.9,"d. The Plus Benefit will be applicable only after exhaustion of Base Sum Insured. 'Cumulative Bonus', 'Optional Benefit: Plus Benefit', 'Optional Benefit: Cumulative Bonus Super' shall not be considered while calculating amount under this Benefit.",EXCLUSION,False,,
CARESU-COV-0521,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.10,"Cumulative Bonus Super ‘Cumulative Bonus Super’ is an extension to Benefit: Cumulative Bonus and hence all the provisions stated under Clause 3.1.3, holds good for Clause 3.2.10 as well, except the below clauses which have been modified for the purpose of this Optional Benefit:",COVERAGE,True,"Cumulative Bonus Super ‘Cumulative Bonus Super’ is an extension to Benefit: Cumulative Bonus and hence all the provisions stated under Clause 3.1.3, holds good for Clause 3.2.10 as well, except the below clauses which have been modified for the purpose of this Optional Benefit:",
CARESU-EXC-0522,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.10(ii),"In any Policy Year, the accrued Cumulative Bonus Super shall not exceed 500% of the Sum Insured available in the expiring Policy or renewed Policy, wherever Sum Insured is lower.",EXCLUSION,False,,
CARESU-COV-0523,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.10(iv),"At the time of Policy renewal if the Policyholder chooses not to renew this Optional Benefit, then the Cumulative Bonus Super under the expiring Policy shall be forfeited.",COVERAGE,False,,
CARESU-EXC-0524,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.10(v),"The Recharge amount ('Unlimited Automatic Recharge'), 'Optional Benefit: Plus Benefit' shall not be considered while calculating 'Cumulative Bonus Super '.",EXCLUSION,False,,
CARESU-COV-0525,Care Health,Care Supreme,3.2. Optional Benefits,3.2.11(a),This Benefit shall be available only once during a Policy Year per Insured Person; and.,COVERAGE,False,,
