OPTIMA-DEF-0695,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,1. Standard Definition,Def. 42,"Reasonable & Customary Charges means the charges for services or supplies, which are the standard charges for a specific provider and consistent with the prevailing charges in the geographical area for identical or similar services, taking into account the nature of illness/ injury involved.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0696,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,1. Standard Definition,Def. 43,Room Rent means the amount charged by a hospital towards room and boarding expenses and shall include associated medical expenses.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-EXC-0697,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,1. Standard Definition,Def. 44,"Renewal means the terms on which the contract of insurance can be renewed on mutual consent with a provision of grace period for treating the renewal continuous for the purpose of gaining credit for pre-existing diseases, time bound exclusions and for all waiting periods.",EXCLUSION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0698,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,1. Standard Definition,Def. 45,"Surgery or Surgical Procedure means manual and/or operative procedure(s) required for treatment of an Illness or injury, correction of deformities and defects, diagnosis and cure of diseases, relief from suffering or prolongation of life, performed in a Hospital or day care centre by a Medical Practitioner.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0699,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,1. Standard Definition,Def. 46,"Unproven/Experimental treatment means treatment including drug experimental therapy which is not based on established medical practice in India, is treatment experimental or unproven.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0700,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 1,Adventurous/Hazardous Sports means any sport or activity involving physical exertion and skill in which an Insured Person participates or competes for entertainment or as part of his Profession whether he / she is trained or not.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0701,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 2,Age means completed years as per last birthday at the inception of the relevant policy year.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-COV-0702,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 3,"Aggregate Deductible means a cost-sharing requirement that provides that the Company will not be liable for a specified amount of the covered expenses in respect of all admissible claims made under the Policy in aggregate, and which will apply before any benefits are payable by the Company. The Aggregate Deductible does not reduce the Sum Insured.",COVERAGE,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0703,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 4,"AYUSH Treatment refers to the medical and/or hospitalisation treatments given under Ayurveda, Yoga and Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha and Homeopathy systems.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0704,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 5,"Base / Basic Sum Insured means the limit opted at the time of inception or modified at the time of renewal whichever is later. It forms a part of the Sum insured for a given Policy Year. It is on per Policy Year basis. In case of Individual Policies, Base Sum Insured shall be on per Insured Person basis. In case of Family Floater policies, a common Base Sum Insured shall be available on a floating basis amongst all the Insured Persons.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0705,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 6,Bank Rate means the rate fixed by the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) at the beginning of the financial year in which claim has fallen due.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0706,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 7,"Break in policy means the period of gap that occurs at the end of the existing policy term/installment premium due date, when the premium due for renewal on a given policy or installment premium due is not paid on or before the premium renewal date or grace period.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0707,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 8,Commencement Date means the commencement date of this Policy as specified in the Schedule.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-EXC-0708,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 9,Contribution means essentially the right of an insurer to call upon other insurers liable to the same insured to share the cost of an indemnity claim on a rateable proportion of Sum Insured. This clause shall not apply to any Benefit offered on fixed benefit basis.,EXCLUSION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0709,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 10,Dependents means only the family members listed below:,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0710,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 11,"Dependent Child means a child (natural or legally adopted), who is unmarried, Aged between.",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0711,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 12,Insured Person means You and the persons named in the Schedule.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0712,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 13,Family Floater means a Policy described as such in the Schedule where under You and Your Dependents named in the Schedule are insured under this Policy as at the Commencement Date. The Sum Insured for a Family Floater means the sum shown in the Schedule which represents Our maximum liability for any and all claims made by You and/or all of Your Dependents during the Policy Period.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0713,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 14,Material Facts means all relevant information sought by the Company in the Proposal Form and other connected documents to enable it to take informed decision in the context of underwriting the risk.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0714,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 15,Non-instalment Premium Payment refers to payment of premium for the entire policy period made in advance as a single premium.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0715,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 16,"Policy means Your statements in the proposal form (which are the basis of this Policy), this policy wording (including endorsements, if any), Annexure 1 and the policy schedule (as the same may be amended from time to time).",DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0716,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 17,Policy Period means the period between the Commencement Date and the Expiry Date specified in the Schedule.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0717,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 18,Policy Year means a year following the Commencement Date and its subsequent annual anniversary.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0718,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 19,Shared accommodation means a Hospital room with two or more patient beds.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-DEF-0719,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 20,Single occupancy or any higher accommodation type means a Hospital room with only one patient bed.,DEFINITION,False,,
OPTIMA-COV-0720,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,2. Specific Definitions,Def. 21,"Sum Insured means the aggregate limit of indemnity consisting of the Base Sum Insured, Multiplier Benefit, and Restore Benefit, Unlimited Restore benefit (provided that these covers are in force). Sum Insured represents the maximum, total and cumulative liability of the Company for any and all claims made under the Policy, in respect of that Insured Person on Individual basis or all Insured Persons on Family Floater basis during the Policy Year.",COVERAGE,True,"Sum Insured means the aggregate limit of indemnity consisting of the Base Sum Insured, Multiplier Benefit, and Restore Benefit, Unlimited Restore benefit (provided that these covers are in force).",
