OPTIMA-COV-0752,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,Benefit,4,"b. In Family Floater policy, the Multiplier Benefit shall be available on Family Floater basis at policy level c. In Family Floater policy, the accrued Multiplier Benefit is available to all Insured Persons under the Policy.",COVERAGE,False,,
OPTIMA-COV-0753,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,Benefit,4,"d. The applicable Multiplier Benefit shall be applied annually only on completion of each Policy Year, and once added, the accumulated amount will be carried forward to the subsequent Policy Year, subject to there being no Break in Policy e. If the Insured Persons in the expiring policy are covered on individual basis and thus have accrued the multiplier bonus for each member in the expiring policy, and such expiring policy is renewed with Us on a Family Floater basis, then the multiplier bonus to be carried forward for credit in the Policy would be the lowest accrued multiplier bonus amongst all the Insured Persons from the expiring Policy.",COVERAGE,True,"The applicable Multiplier Benefit shall be applied annually only on completion of each Policy Year, and once added, the accumulated amount will be carried forward to the subsequent Policy Year, subject to there being no Break in Policy e.",
