OPTIMA-EXC-0766,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,1. Standard Waiting Periods,,"Orthopedic • Non infective arthritis • Gout and Rheumatism • Osteoporosis • Ligament, Tendon and Meniscal tear • Prolapsed inter vertebral disk Gastrointestinal • Cholelithiasis • Cholecystitis • Pancreatitis • Fissure/fistula in anus, Haemorrhoids, Pilonidal sinus • Gastro Esophageal Reflux Disorder (GERD), Ulcer and erosion of stomach and duodenum • Cirrhosis (However Alcoholic cirrhosis is permanently excluded) • Perineal and Perianal Abscess • Rectal Prolapse Urogenital • Calculus diseases of Urogenital system including Kidney, ureter, Surgeries / procedure • Hysterectomy • Joint replacement surgeries • Cholecystectomy • Surgery of hernia • Surgery on prostate • Surgery for Hydrocele/ bladder stones • Benign Hyperplasia of prostate • Varicocele Rectocele Eye • Cataract • Retinal detachment • Glaucoma • Nil Others • NIL • Surgery of varicose veins and varicose ulcers General (Applicable to • Benign tumors of Non infectious etiologye. eg. cysts, nodules, polyps, lump, growth, etc • Nil all organ systems/organs whether or not described above)",EXCLUSION,True,"Orthopedic • Non infective arthritis • Gout and Rheumatism • Osteoporosis • Ligament, Tendon and Meniscal tear • Prolapsed inter vertebral disk Gastrointestinal • Cholelithiasis • Cholecystitis • Pancreatitis • Fissure/fistula in anus, Haemorrhoids, Pilonidal sinus • Gastro Esophageal Reflux Disorder (GERD), Ulcer and erosion of stomach and duodenum • Cirrhosis (However Alcoholic cirrhosis is permanently excluded) • Perineal and Perianal Abscess • Rectal Prolapse Urogenital • Calculus diseases of Urogenital system including Kidney, ureter, Surgeries / procedure • Hysterectomy • Joint replaceme",
