OPTIMA-WAI-0800,HDFC ERGO,Optima Restore,SECTION D. GENERAL TERMS AND CLAUSES,1,"m. Migration The Insured Person will have the option to migrate the Policy to other health insurance products/plans offered by the Company by applying for Migration of the policyatleast30 days before the policy renewal date as per IRDAI guidelines on Migration. If such person is presently covered and has been continuously covered without any lapses under any health insurance product/plan offered by the Company, the Insured Person will get the accrued continuity benefits in waiting periods as per IRDAI guidelines on Migration.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
