COMPLE-COV-1451,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,1,"Hospital Daily Cash We will pay You a daily fixed amount, as stated against this Optional Cover in the Policy Schedule, for each and every continuous completed day of Hospitalization up to a maximum of 10 consecutive days, if such Hospitalization is at least for a minimum of 3 consecutive days and it falls within the Policy Year. The Claim under this Optional Cover will be payable only if We have admitted Our liability under “In-patient Treatment” section of the Policy. This Optional Cover is payable only once to an Insured Person during each Policy Year of the Policy Period.",COVERAGE,False,,10 days; 3 days
COMPLE-COV-1452,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,2,"Convalescence Benefit We will pay You an amount of Rs. 10,000 if You are Hospitalized for a minimum period of 10 consecutive days, due to any Injury or Illness as covered under the Policy. This Optional Cover is payable only once to an Insured Person during each Policy Year of the Policy Period.",COVERAGE,False,,10 days
COMPLE-COV-1453,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,3,"Nursing at Home post Hospitalisation We will pay You for the expenses incurred by You, up to Rs. xxx for each day (as per plan eligibility/depending on annual sum insured) up to a maximum of 15 days post Hospitalization for the medical services of a Qualified Nurse at Your residence, provided that the nurse is employed in a Hospital and the engagement of such Qualified Nurse is certified as necessary by a Medical Practitioner and relate directly to any Illness or Injury, covered under the Policy.",COVERAGE,True,"Nursing at Home post Hospitalisation We will pay You for the expenses incurred by You, up to Rs. xxx for each day (as per plan eligibility/depending on annual sum insured) up to a maximum of 15 days post Hospitalization for the medical services of a Qualified Nurse at Your residence, provided that the nurse is employed in a Hospital and the engagement of such Qualified Nurse is certified as necessary by a Medical Practitioner and relate directly to any Illness or Injury, covered under the Policy.",15 days
COMPLE-COV-1454,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,3,The Claim under this Optional Cover will be payable only if We have admitted Our liability under “In-patient Treatment” section of the Policy.,COVERAGE,False,,
COMPLE-DEF-1455,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,3,"For the purpose of this extension, the term “Qualified Nurse” means a person who holds a valid registration from the Nursing Council of India or the Nursing Council of any state in India.",DEFINITION,False,,
COMPLE-COV-1456,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,4,"Compassionate Visit In event of Your Hospitalization, which in the opinion of the Medical Practitioner attending on You, extends beyond a period of 5 consecutive days, We will indemnify the cost of the economy class air ticket incurred by Your Immediate Family Member from and to the place of origin of such Family Member or the place of residence of the Family Member.",COVERAGE,False,,5 days
COMPLE-EXC-1457,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,4,"Our liability under this Optional Cover, however, in respect of any one event or all events of Hospitalization during the Policy Year shall not in aggregate exceed Rs. 20,000 per Policy Year of Policy Period.",EXCLUSION,True,"Our liability under this Optional Cover, however, in respect of any one event or all events of Hospitalization during the Policy Year shall not in aggregate exceed Rs. 20,000 per Policy Year of Policy Period.",
COMPLE-COV-1458,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,5,"Critical Illness We will pay You or Your Nominee / legal heir the Sum Insured as stated against this Optional Cover in the Policy Schedule, in case You are diagnosed as suffering from one or more of the Critical Illnesses for the first time in your life, during the Policy Period.",COVERAGE,False,,
COMPLE-COV-1459,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,General,5,"However, We will not make any payment if You are first diagnosed as suffering from a Critical Illness within 90 days of the Period of Insurance Start Date. This Optional Cover can be availed by You only once during Your lifetime. No Claim under this Optional Cover shall be admissible in case any of the Critical Illnesses is a consequence of or.",COVERAGE,True,"However, We will not make any payment if You are first diagnosed as suffering from a Critical Illness within 90 days of the Period of Insurance Start Date.",90 days
