COMPLE-COV-1504,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,optional covers,13,Sum Insured Protector The Sum Insured Protector Cover is designed to protect the Annual Sum Insured against rising inflation by linking the Annual Sum Insured under the Basic Cover to the Consumer Price index (CPI). The Annual Sum Insured will be increased on cumulative basis at each Renewal on the basis of inflation rate in previous year. Inflation rate would be computed as the average CPI of the entire calendar year published by the Central Statistical Organisation (CSO).,COVERAGE,False,,
