COMPLE-COV-1536,ICICI Lombard,Complete Health Insurance,1. CLAIMS PROCEDURE,,"Claim falling in two Policy Periods If the claim event falls within two Policy periods, the claims shall be paid taking into consideration the available Sum Insured in the two Policy Periods, including the Deductibles for each Policy Period. Such eligible claim amount to be payable to the Insured shall be reduced to the extent of premium to be received for the Renewal/due date of premium of health insurance Policy, if not received earlier.",COVERAGE,False,,
