ELEVAT-COV-1617,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,General,14,"In-Patient Hospitalization for Oocyte Donor We will cover Medical Expenses incurred in respect of Hospitalization of the Oocyte Donor, appointed by You who is the “Commissioning Couple”/”Commissioning Woman”, for complications arising out of Oocyte retrieval subject to the following conditions:",COVERAGE,True,"In-Patient Hospitalization for Oocyte Donor We will cover Medical Expenses incurred in respect of Hospitalization of the Oocyte Donor, appointed by You who is the “Commissioning Couple”/”Commissioning Woman”, for complications arising out of Oocyte retrieval subject to the following conditions:",
