ELEVAT-EXC-1729,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,32,"2 - Hour Hospitalization: We will cover the Medical Expenses incurred in respect of Your Hospitalization for 2 hours or more (minimum 24 hours for AYUSH Treatment in a AYUSH Hospital) for the following: i. Room Rent up to Single Private AC room; ii. Intensive Care Unit Charges; iii. Qualified Nurse charges; iv. Medical Practitioner’s fees; v. Anesthesia, blood, oxygen, operation theatre charges, medicines, drugs and consumables (other than those specified in the list of excluded expenses (non-medical) in Annexure II).",EXCLUSION,False,,2 hours; 24 hours
ELEVAT-EXC-1730,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,32,"This benefit is subject to the following: i. If You are admitted to a room with a Room Rent or category higher than that specified in the Policy Schedule, then Associated Medical Expenses shall be payable on a pro-rata basis. However, pro-rate deductions shall not apply to ICU Charges or where the Hospital does not follow differential billing or where expenses are not charged based on the room category. ii. This benefit does not include expenses associated with (1) the use of automation machines for peritoneal dialysis and (2) the Hospitalization of the Insured Person in case there was no active line of treatment and only diagnostic or investigative procedures were performed (e.g., MRI, CT Scan, Endoscopy, Colonoscopy, etc). iii. Treatments or procedures covered under this add on and “Day care procedures/ Treatment” are separate. iv. If this add on is opted by you, treatments like IV Fluid Therapy for Severe Dehydration, Platelet Transfusions, Iron Infusions, Ligament Sprain & Immobilization etc. will be covered in addition to the treatments covered under In-patient Hospitalization. Please note the above mentioned treatments are indicative only. 33. Vital Essence: If you are hospitalized during the Policy Period for any of the listed Illnesses or Conditions mentioned in the sub-limits table below and this optional cover has been opted, then our total liability for all treatments related to those illnesses or procedures during the Policy Year shall be capped at the amount corresponding to the respective category. The sub-limits defined under this section shall be applicable for the Policy Lifetime starting from Policy Inception. A co-payment of a pre-defined percentage shall be applicable on each and every claim made by you under this policy during the policy year, irrespective of whether the claim pertains to the listed Illnesses or Conditions mentioned in the sub-limits table forming part of this optional add-on. This co-payment shall apply uniformly across all claims, beyond the scope of the sub-limits table in this policy. The pre-defined co-payment shall be applied first on the admissible claim amount, and subsequently, the applicable sub-limit (if any) shall be applied to arrive at the final payable amount. If you opt for this optional add-on, you shall not be eligible to opt for the Voluntary Co-payment optional add-on & Voluntary Deductible optional add-on under the same policy. Additionally, if this optional add-on is opted, the Reset Benefit shall be triggered only once instead of unlimited times for any illness / injury / disease during a Policy Year up to the Sum Insured as specified in the Policy Schedule. The premium applicable will reflect the inclusion of the Vital Essence add-on, along with adjustments made based on your health profile at the time of policy issuance.",EXCLUSION,True,"However, pro-rate deductions shall not apply to ICU Charges or where the Hospital does not follow differential billing or where expenses are not charged based on the room category. ii.",
ELEVAT-COV-1731,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,32,"I Rs. 2,00,000 Rs. 1,44,000 Final payable amount to Insured Person [lesser amount out of F,G,I]",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1732,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,32,"NA** Rs. 24,000 Rs. 96,000 Rs. 96,000 * It has been assumed that total claimed expenses are same as total payable expenses. i.e. there are no deductions in the claimed amount ** As Diagnosis / Treatment mentioned in [C] does not fall under Sub limit section.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1733,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Elevate HER – WOMEN CARE ADD-ON The Elevate HER – Women Care Add-on has been designed exclusively for women covered under the Elevate base health insurance policy. You can select one eligible Elevate HER Plan for each covered female member. The selected Plan will always run along with the base Policy Period and can be renewed only together with the base Policy. Elevate HER Plans are valid PAN India and must be renewed annually for single-year policies and at the time of renewal for multi-year base policies. For the purpose of this Add-on, the age of the Insured Person shall be determined based on the completed age as on the date of inception of this Add-on or at renewal, as applicable. Where an Insured Person attains an age beyond the eligibility criteria of the selected Elevate HER Plan during the Policy Period, all benefits and coverage under such Elevate HER Plan shall continue to be available until the expiry of the Policy Period. The Elevate HER Add-on shall be co-terminus with the Base Policy and shall be eligible for renewal subject to the applicable age and plan eligibility criteria at the time of renewal. The premium for the Elevate HER Add-on shall not be refunded or prorated solely on account of any change in age eligibility during the Policy Period. If you have Elevate HER plan along with any other add-on or optional cover that offers outpatient consultations, diagnostic tests, Health checkup, diet, teleconsultation and nutrition counselling, or mental wellness counselling, the benefits under Elevate HER- Women care add on will be available to you in addition to the benefits provided under such other add-on , subject to the terms and limits applicable to each. Any unutilized Consultations / E- consultations / Sum Insured / Sessions cannot be carried forward to the next Policy Year. The following Plans are available under the Elevate HER – Women Care Add-on: Elevate HER Bloom, Elevate HER Nurture, Elevate HER Thrive and Elevate HER Harmony (Standard Variant) and Elevate HER Bloom Plus, Elevate HER Nurture Plus, Elevate HER Thrive Plus and Elevate HER Harmony Plus (Plus Variant). Each Plan may be opted in either:",EXCLUSION,True,The Elevate HER Add-on shall be co-terminus with the Base Policy and shall be eligible for renewal subject to the applicable age and plan eligibility criteria at the time of renewal.,
ELEVAT-COV-1734,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"a. Standard Variant; or b. Plus Variant, which provides additional benefits as specified under Clause 34.1.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1735,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"ELEVATE HER BLOOM – ADOLESCENT & EARLY REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH ADD-ON This Plan is available if you are between 14 to 22 years of age. You may renew this Plan only until you reach 22 years. After that, you must move to the next eligible Elevate HER Plan at renewal. If you have a multi-year base Policy, the transition to the next Plan will take place only at the time of renewal, even if you cross the eligible age mid-term.",COVERAGE,False,,22 years
ELEVAT-COV-1736,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Diagnostic credits We will provide a Diagnostic credit points for each Policy Year, representing the maximum payable limit for all diagnostic tests covered under this Plan.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1737,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Under Elevate HER Bloom, the eligible diagnostic tests shall include CBC, FBS, TSH, Vitamin D, Serum Ferritin, Urine Routine & Microscopy and HbA1c. These tests shall be availed only as a bundled health check-up, without the requirement of a consultation prescription, on a cashless basis through our partner network.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1738,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"USG is included under this Plan and shall be covered only if advised by a gynaecologist. The test may be availed at any diagnostic centre on cashless (within network) or reimbursement mode. Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the USG report, payment receipt and consultation note from Gynaecologist, limited to the available Diagnostic credit balance.",COVERAGE,True,"Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the USG report, payment receipt and consultation note from Gynaecologist, limited to the available Diagnostic credit balance.",
ELEVAT-EXC-1739,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"The aggregate amount payable for all diagnostics, including the bundled health check-up tests and USG Pelvis, shall be limited to 2,000 credit points per Policy Year. Diagnostics availed beyond the available Diagnostic credit balance or outside the scope of this Plan shall not be payable.",EXCLUSION,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1740,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"This benefit is in addition to any Optional Cover for Health Check-up, diagnostic test for Be-fit if opted and specified in the Policy Schedule.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1741,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit -OPD Consultations We will cover up to two (2) physical outpatient gynecology consultations per Policy Year on a cashless basis through our network, subject to an aggregate sub-limit of ₹1,500 per Policy Year, whichever is lower. This benefit shall be available over and above the outpatient consultation limits, if any, provided under the BeFit Optional Cover, where opted for and specified in the Policy Schedule. Consultations in excess of the above limits or availed outside our network shall not be payable. A 30-day initial Waiting Period applies on Diagnostic credits and Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit- OPD Consultations unless renewed continuously.",EXCLUSION,True,A 30-day initial Waiting Period applies on Diagnostic credits and Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit- OPD Consultations unless renewed continuously.,
ELEVAT-COV-1742,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"ELEVATE HER THRIVE – WOMEN’S PREVENTIVE & HORMONAL WELLNESS ADD-ON This Plan is available if you are 23 to 45 years. If you were earlier covered under Elevate HER Bloom and have completed 22 years, you must move to this Plan or to Elevate HER Nurture at renewal.",COVERAGE,False,,45 years; 22 years
ELEVAT-COV-1743,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Diagnostic credits We will provide a Diagnostic credits for each Policy Year, representing the maximum payable limit for all diagnostic tests covered under this Plan.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1744,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Under Elevate HER Thrive , the eligible diagnostic tests shall include CBC, FBS, HbA1c, TSH, LFT, Lipid Profile, Vitamin D, Serum Ferritin and Urine Routine & Microscopy. These tests shall be availed only as a bundled health check-up, without the requirement of a consultation prescription, on a cashless basis through our partner network.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1745,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,USG is included under this Plan and shall be covered only if advised by a gynaecologist. The test may be availed at any diagnostic centre on cashless (within network) or reimbursement mode.,COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1746,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the USG report, payment receipt and consultation note from Gynaecologist, limited to the available Diagnostic credit balance.",COVERAGE,True,"Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the USG report, payment receipt and consultation note from Gynaecologist, limited to the available Diagnostic credit balance.",
ELEVAT-WAI-1747,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Pap smear is included under this Plan after a waiting period of one (1) Policy Year, i.e., from the second Policy Year onwards. After the first use, it can be availed once every two (2) Policy Years. The test may be availed at any diagnostic centre on cashless (within network) or reimbursement mode. Reimbursement shall be subjected to submission of the test report and payment receipt, limited to the available Diagnostic credit balance.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1748,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"The aggregate amount payable for all diagnostics, including the bundled health check-up tests, USG and Pap smear, shall be limited to 2,500 credit points per Policy Year. Diagnostics availed beyond the available Diagnostic credit balance or outside the scope of this Plan shall not be payable.",EXCLUSION,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1749,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit -OPD Consultations We will cover up to two (2) physical outpatient gynaecology consultations per Policy Year on a cashless basis through our network, subject to an aggregate sub-limit of ₹1,500 per Policy Year, whichever is lower. This benefit shall be available over and above the outpatient consultation limits, if any, provided under the BeFit Optional Cover, where opted for and specified in the Policy Schedule. Consultations in excess of the above limits or availed outside our network shall not be payable. A 30-day initial Waiting Period applies on Diagnostic credit and Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit- OPD Consultations unless renewed continuously.",EXCLUSION,True,A 30-day initial Waiting Period applies on Diagnostic credit and Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit- OPD Consultations unless renewed continuously.,
ELEVAT-COV-1750,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"ELEVATE HER NURTURE – MATERNITY, WELLNESS & ART ADD-ON This Plan is available if you are 23 to 45 years and are covered as an adult under an individual or floater base Policy with a base Sum Insured of ₹7.5 lakh or aboveWe will also cover:",COVERAGE,False,,45 years
ELEVAT-WAI-1751,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34," Pre-natal expenses (from conception until delivery), and  Post-natal expenses up to 30 days after delivery —but only when these form part of an admissible inpatient maternity claim.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,30 days
ELEVAT-WAI-1752,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,This optional cover will have a waiting period of 24 months for maternity cover from the date it is opted and specified in the Policy Schedule.,WAITING_PERIOD,False,,24 months
ELEVAT-COV-1753,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Artificial Reproductive technology (ART) Cover We will cover medically necessary ART procedures including artificial insemination and advanced reproductive technologies such as IVF, ZIFT, GIFT, ICSI and IUI, performed at Government registered centres as per The Assisted Reproductive Technology (Regulation) Act, 2021 and associated rules for insured female only.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-WAI-1754,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"One ART procedure is admissible per Policy Year after completing a 3-year Waiting Period (from the date it is opted and specified in the Policy Schedule),with a lifetime maximum of three procedures. Pre-procedure tests, drug therapy, oocyte retrieval, embryo transfer and daycare treatment for Artificial Reproductive technology (ART) will be covered for insured female only. ART for elective or non- medical reasons will not be covered.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1755,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Expenses incurred for male diagnostic tests, male drug therapy, surgical sperm retrieval procedures performed exclusively for the male partner, and any procedure or treatment undertaken for male partner shall not be covered under this Add-on.",EXCLUSION,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1756,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Maternity Event and ART Coverage Limit under Elevate HER Nurture This Optional Cover provides a separate Sum Insured for Maternity event and ART benefits over and above the Base Policy Sum Insured, subject to the terms and limits of this Optional Cover. The applicable Sum Insured depends on the Base Policy Sum Insured, as shown in the table below.",COVERAGE,True,"Maternity Event and ART Coverage Limit under Elevate HER Nurture This Optional Cover provides a separate Sum Insured for Maternity event and ART benefits over and above the Base Policy Sum Insured, subject to the terms and limits of this Optional Cover.",
ELEVAT-WAI-1757,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Any treatment related to the complication of pregnancy or termination will be treated within the maternity event sub limits. On Renewal, if an enhanced sub-limit is applicable under this Add on, waiting period as mentioned above for Maternity and ART would apply afresh to the extent of the increased coverage limit.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1758,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Base SI Coverage limit for Maternity+ART ₹7.5 lakh ₹75,000 ₹10 lakh ₹1,00,000 ₹15 lakh ₹1,00,000 ₹20 lakh ₹1,00 ,000 ₹25 lakh ₹1,50,000 ₹50 lakh ₹1,50,000 ₹1 crore ₹2,00,000 ₹3 crore ₹2,00,000 Unlimited ₹2,00,000 Digital & Wellness Services We will provide unlimited teleconsultations with gynaecologists (Elevate HER Gynae care plus), nutritionists (Elevate HER Nutri care Plus) and mental health (Elevate HER Mind Care Plus)professionals through our designated digital platform. You will also have access to app-based services (Elevate HER Wellness Hub) such as lactation support, postpartum fitness, childbirth and parenting workshops, fertility preservation counselling, cord blood banking awareness, menstrual tracking tools and mental health programs through our designated digital partner (ILTC app). Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit -OPD Consultations We will cover up to two (2) physical outpatient gynaecology (includes Obstetrician consultation)consultations per Policy Year on a cashless basis through our network, subject to an aggregate sub-limit of ₹1,500 per Policy Year, whichever is lower. This benefit shall be available over and above the outpatient consultation limits, if any, provided under the BeFit Optional Cover, where opted for and specified in the Policy Schedule. Consultations in excess of the above limits or availed outside our network shall not be payable.",EXCLUSION,True,"Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit -OPD Consultations We will cover up to two (2) physical outpatient gynaecology (includes Obstetrician consultation)consultations per Policy Year on a cashless basis through our network, subject to an aggregate sub-limit of ₹1,500 per Policy Year, whichever is lower.",
ELEVAT-COV-1759,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Diagnostic credit points We will provide a Diagnostic credits for each Policy Year, representing the maximum payable limit for all diagnostic tests covered under this Plan.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1760,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Under Elevate HER Nurture, the eligible diagnostic tests shall include CBC, FBS, TSH, Urine Routine & Microscopy, HbA1c, LFT, Lipid Profile, Vitamin D, FSH, LH and Prolactin. These tests shall be availed only as a bundled health check-up, without the requirement of a consultation prescription, on a cashless basis through our partner network.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1761,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"The aggregate amount payable for all diagnostics, including the bundled health check-up tests, USG and Pap smear, shall be limited to 3,000 credits points per Policy Year. Diagnostics availed beyond the available Diagnostic credit balance or outside the scope of this Plan shall not be payable.",EXCLUSION,False,,
ELEVAT-WAI-1762,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Waiting Periods: 24 months for maternity, 36 months for ART, and 30 days for Diagnostic credits and Elevate HER GynaeCare-OPD ConsultationVisit unless renewed continuously.",WAITING_PERIOD,True,"Waiting Periods: 24 months for maternity, 36 months for ART, and 30 days for Diagnostic credits and Elevate HER GynaeCare-OPD ConsultationVisit unless renewed continuously.",24 months; 36 months; 30 days
ELEVAT-WAI-1763,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"ART conducted at non-ICMR centres, elective abortions, expenses beyond financial limits, cosmetic care and claims arising within applicable Waiting Periods will not be covered.",WAITING_PERIOD,False,,
ELEVAT-COV-1764,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit -OPD Cover We will cover up to two (2) physical outpatient gynaecology consultations per Policy Year on a cashless basis through our network, subject to an aggregate sub-limit of INR1,500 per Policy Year, whichever is lower. This benefit shall be available over and above the outpatient consultation limits, if any, provided under the BeFit Optional Cover, where opted for and specified in the Policy Schedule.",COVERAGE,True,"Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit -OPD Cover We will cover up to two (2) physical outpatient gynaecology consultations per Policy Year on a cashless basis through our network, subject to an aggregate sub-limit of INR1,500 per Policy Year, whichever is lower.",
ELEVAT-EXC-1765,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,Consultations in excess of the above limits or availed outside our network shall not be payable.,EXCLUSION,False,,
ELEVAT-WAI-1766,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"Diagnostic credits We will provide a Diagnostic credit points for each Policy Year, representing the maximum payable limit for all diagnostic tests covered under this Plan. Under Elevate HER Harmony, the eligible health check-up tests shall include CBC, FBS, HbA1c, TSH, LFT, Lipid Profile, Vitamin D and Vitamin B12, Urine routine and microscopy. These tests shall be availed only as a bundled annual health check-up, without the requirement of a consultation prescription, on a cashless basis through our partner network. DEXA scan, Mammography, Pap smear and TMT/ECG are included under this Plan after a waiting period of one (1) Policy Year, i.e., from the second Policy Year onwards. After the first use, it can be availed once every two (2) Policy Years. These tests may be availed at any diagnostic centre, on cashless (within network) or reimbursement mode without the requirement of a doctor’s advice. Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the test reports and payment receipts, limited to the available Diagnostic credits balance.",WAITING_PERIOD,True,"Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the test reports and payment receipts, limited to the available Diagnostic credits balance.",
ELEVAT-COV-1767,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"USG is included under this Plan and shall be covered only if advised by a gynaecologist. The test may be availed at any diagnostic centre on cashless (within network) or reimbursement mode. Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the USG report, payment receipt and consultation note from Gynaecologist, limited to the available Diagnostic credits balance.",COVERAGE,True,"Reimbursement shall be subject to submission of the USG report, payment receipt and consultation note from Gynaecologist, limited to the available Diagnostic credits balance.",
ELEVAT-COV-1768,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,"The aggregate amount payable for all diagnostics, including the bundled health check-up tests, USG, DEXA scan, Mamogram, Pap smear and TMT/ECG shall be limited to 4,500 credit points per Policy Year.",COVERAGE,False,,
ELEVAT-EXC-1769,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,Diagnostics availed beyond the available Diagnostic credit balance or outside the scope of this Plan shall not be payable.,EXCLUSION,False,,
ELEVAT-WAI-1770,ICICI Lombard,Elevate Health,Optional Cover,34,A 30-day initial Waiting Period applies on Diagnostic credits and Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit- OPD Consultations unless renewed continuously.,WAITING_PERIOD,True,A 30-day initial Waiting Period applies on Diagnostic credits and Elevate HER GynaeCare Visit- OPD Consultations unless renewed continuously.,
