HEALTH-COV-1933,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,12,Domiciliary Hospitalization We will cover the Medical Expenses incurred in respect of the Domiciliary Hospitalization of the Insured Person during the Policy Period provided that the Domiciliary Hospitalization has commenced on the written advice of a medical practitioner and continues for at least 3 consecutive days in which case we will make payment under this Cover in respect of Medical Expenses incurred from the first day of Domiciliary Hospitalization.,COVERAGE,True,Domiciliary Hospitalization We will cover the Medical Expenses incurred in respect of the Domiciliary Hospitalization of the Insured Person during the Policy Period provided that the Domiciliary Hospitalization has commenced on the written advice of a medical practitioner and continues for at least 3 consecutive days in which case we will make payment under this Cover in respect of Medical Expenses incurred from the first day of Domiciliary Hospitalization.,3 days
