HEALTH-EXC-1984,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,18(i),"Class III: Marked limitation of physical activity. Comfortable at rest, but less than ordinary activity causes symptoms. ii. Class IV: Unable to engage in any physical activity without discomfort.Symptoms may be present even at rest. III. Pulmonary hypertension associated with lung disease, chronic hypoventilation,pulmonary thromboembolic disease, drugs and toxins, diseases of the left side of the heart, and any secondary cause are specifically excluded.",EXCLUSION,False,,
HEALTH-COV-1985,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,"Personal Accident We will pay You or Your Nominee / legal heir, as the case may be, the Annual Sum Insured subject to a maximum limit of Rs.50 Lakhs , on occurrence of any Insured Event, as specifically described hereunder, arising due to an Injury sustained by You during the Policy Year. This cover is available only for adult members aged maximum up to 65 years during first time issuance.",COVERAGE,True,"Personal Accident We will pay You or Your Nominee / legal heir, as the case may be, the Annual Sum Insured subject to a maximum limit of Rs.50 Lakhs , on occurrence of any Insured Event, as specifically described hereunder, arising due to an Injury sustained by You during the Policy Year.",65 years
HEALTH-COV-1986,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,"a. Accidental Death We shall pay 100% of the coverage amount of the Insured / Insured Person, in the event of his / her Death on account of an Accident / Injury, during the Policy Period or within twelve calendar months from the date of occurrence of such Accident / Injury which occurred during Policy Period.",COVERAGE,False,,12 months
HEALTH-COV-1987,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,"b. Permanent Total Disablement We shall pay up to the coverage amount of the Insured Person as specified below in case of his / her permanent total disablement on account of any Accident / Injury, during the Policy Period or within twelve calendar months from the date of occurrence of such Accident / Injury which occurred during Policy Period. The payout of the Sum Insured shall be as per table below:",COVERAGE,False,,12 months
