HEALTH-COV-1989,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,I 100% Total and irrecoverable loss 100% (a) use of two hands or two feet (b) one hand and one foot (c)sight of one eye and use of one hand or one foot II Total and irrecoverable loss of sight of one eye or the actual loss by physical separation of one entire hand or one entire foot III 50% IV Total and irrecoverable loss of use of one entire hand or one entire foot without physical separation 50% V Paraplegia or Quadriplegia or Hemiplegia 100%.,COVERAGE,False,,
HEALTH-COV-1990,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,"NOTE: For the purpose of Sr. No. I to IV in the table above, physical separation of a hand or foot shall mean separation of the hand at or above the wrist, and of the foot at or above the ankle. For the purpose of this Benefit only: (I) “Hemiplegia” means complete and irrecoverable paralysis of the arm, leg, and trunk on the same side of the body; (II) “Paraplegia” means complete and irrecoverable paralysis of the whole of the lower half of the body (below waist) including both the legs; (III) “Quadriplegia” means complete and irrecoverable paralysis of all four limbs.",COVERAGE,False,,
HEALTH-COV-1991,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,"c. Permanent Partial Disablement We shall pay up to the coverage amount of the Insured Person as specified below in case of his / her permanent partial disablement on account of any Accident / Injury, during the Policy Period or within twelve calendar months from the date of occurrence of such Accident / Injury which occurred during Policy Period. The payout of the Sum Insured shall be as per table below:",COVERAGE,False,,12 months
HEALTH-COV-1992,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,5,Amount payable = % of the Sun Insured specified in the policy schedule Sr.No Insured Events I Total and irrecoverable loss of hearing in: -.,COVERAGE,False,,
