HEALTH-EXC-2007,ICICI Lombard,Health AdvantEdge,General,8,"Physiotherapy Session Count of sessions 0 0 6 8 10 12 12 e-Counselling Count of sessions 6 6 6 8 12 Unlimited Unlimited Count of sessions 6 6 6 8 12 Unlimited Unlimited Diet and Nutrition e- Consultation Claim Procedure for BeFit All claims will be adjudicated only on cashless basis via our mobile application and are subject to the terms, conditions, and exclusions of the Policy and the availability of the Sum Insured. Cashless Facility is only available at specific Network Providers/Health Service Provider available on the mobile application. We reserve the right to modify, add or restrict any Network Provider/Health Service Provider for Cashless facility at Our sole discretion.",EXCLUSION,False,,
