HEALTH-COV-2223,ICICI Lombard,Health Shield 360,General,11,Domiciliary Hospitalization We will cover the Medical Expenses incurred in respect of the Domiciliary Hospitalization of the Insured Person during the Policy Period provided that:,COVERAGE,True,Domiciliary Hospitalization We will cover the Medical Expenses incurred in respect of the Domiciliary Hospitalization of the Insured Person during the Policy Period provided that:,
HEALTH-COV-2224,ICICI Lombard,Health Shield 360,General,11(i),The Domiciliary Hospitalization continues for at least 3 consecutive days in which case we will make payment under this Cover in respect of Medical Expenses incurred from the first day of Domiciliary Hospitalization.,COVERAGE,False,,3 days
