HEALTH-EXC-2267,ICICI Lombard,Health Shield 360,General,7,"a. The Cover shall be available after 24/36 months (as per the plan opted) of continuous coverage have elapsed since the inception of the first Policy with Us. b. Pre- and Post-Hospitalization expenses will not be covered under this Cover c. This Cover is available only under a family floater Policy d. This Cover is available for You or Your spouse provided You and Your spouse, both are covered under the same family floater Policy e. We will not cover ectopic pregnancy under this Cover (the same shall be covered under In-patient Treatment)",EXCLUSION,False,,36 months
