STARCO-COV-2678,Star Health,Star Comprehensive,General,27(i),"Where the policy is issued for more than 1 year, the Basic Sum Insured including sublimits, cumulative bonus (if applicable), automatic restoration benefit (if applicable) is for each of the year, without any carry over benefit thereof. The said benefits / covers available for the 2nd year or 3rd year cannot be utilized in the 1st year itself. The terms conditions and exceptions that appear in the Policy or in any Endorsement are part of the contract, must be complied with and applies to each Policy Year.",COVERAGE,False,,1 year
