FAMILY-EXC-2816,Star Health,Family Health Optima,STANDARD DEFINITIONS,3,"30-day waiting period - Code Excl 03 A. Expenses related to the treatment of any illness within 30 days from the ﬁrst policy commencement date shall be excluded except claims arising due to an accident, provided the same are covered B. This exclusion shall not, however, apply if the Insured Person has continuous coverage for more than twelve months C. The within referred waiting period is made applicable to the enhanced Sum Insured in the event of granting higher Sum Insured subsequently.",EXCLUSION,True,"Expenses related to the treatment of any illness within 30 days from the ﬁrst policy commencement date shall be excluded except claims arising due to an accident, provided the same are covered B.",30 days; 12 months
