FAMILY-EXC-2820,Star Health,Family Health Optima,STANDARD DEFINITIONS,8,"Cosmetic or plastic Surgery - Code Excl 08: Expenses for cosmetic or plastic surgery or any treatment to change appearance unless for reconstruction following an Accident, Burn(s) or Cancer or as part of medically necessary treatment to remove a direct and immediate health risk to the insured. For this to be considered a medical necessity, it must be certiﬁed by the attending Medical Practitioner.",EXCLUSION,True,"Cosmetic or plastic Surgery - Code Excl 08: Expenses for cosmetic or plastic surgery or any treatment to change appearance unless for reconstruction following an Accident, Burn(s) or Cancer or as part of medically necessary treatment to remove a direct and immediate health risk to the insured.",
