STARWO-COV-2896,Star Health,Star Women Care,General,,"• If the Insured is a Oocyte Donor: The policy term will be given for one year. They can also opt for two or three years cover. However, post 12 months, all other coverages will continue except Oocyte Donor Cover • If the Insured is both Surrogate Mother and Oocyte Donor: The policy term will be given for three years. However, Oocyte Donor cover will be restricted to one year.",COVERAGE,True,"However, post 12 months, all other coverages will continue except Oocyte Donor Cover • If the Insured is both Surrogate Mother and Oocyte Donor: The policy term will be given for three years.",1 year; 3 years; 12 months
